; claude: animation, Core Animation's ideas (Apple, 2007) from scratch:
; timing curves as cubic Beziers (Timing), a value on its way from one
; place to another and implicit animations (Animation), a layout's
; rectangles moving to another layout (Transition). Plain numbers and
; rectangles, no Playground; pure OCaml, native and web. In the package
; tiny_libs, as tiny_libs.graphics_animation.
